OL,3,AJeff Bezos says he was 'heavily
OL,4,Ainvolved' in casting Robert Pattinson
OL,5,Aas new 007
OL,6,
OL,7,FJeff Bezos has said he was "heavily
OL,8,Finvolved" in casting Robert Pattinson
OL,9,Fas the new James Bond.
OL,11,FSpeaking at an event in California, the
OL,12,FAmazon CEO said he was originally
OL,13,F"biased against" Pattinson - who
OL,14,Fstarred in many blockbuster films like
OL,15,FBatman and the Twilight series -
OL,16,F"because he's already so famous".
OL,18,FThe role of 007 has typically gone to
OL,19,Fan actor who is not as well known at
OL,20,Fthe time of casting. But Bezos said in
OL,21,Fscreen tests, "it was so obvious he is
OL,22,FJames Bond".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
